content='```yml\n---\n- name: Download RKE2 kubeconfig to localhost\n  fetch:\n    content: /etc/rancher/rke2/rke2.yaml\n    flat: yes\n    dest: "{{ rke2_download_kubeconf_path }}{{ rke2_download_kubeconf_file_name }}"\n    src: /etc/rancher/rke2/rke2.yaml\n  when: rke2_download_kubeconf and inventory_hostname == groups[rke2_servers_group_name][0]\n\n- name: Replace loopback IP by master server IP\n  ansible.builtin.replace:\n    path: "{{ rke2_download_kubeconf_path }}{{ rke2_download_kubeconf_file_name }}"\n    regexp: \'127\\.0\\.0\\.1|\\[::1\\]\'\n    replace: \'{{ (rke2_api_ip | default(ansible_host)) if rke2_api_ip else (ansible.utils.ipwrap(ansible_host)) }}\'\n    backup: yes\n  delegate_to: localhost\n  become: false\n  when: not ansible_check_mode and rke2_download_kubeconf and inventory_hostname == groups[rke2_servers_group_name][0]\n  mode: \'0600\'\n```' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'llama3.1:8b', 'created_at': '2025-10-17T05:07:44.019057491Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 2316911120, 'load_duration': 107434728, 'prompt_eval_count': 642, 'prompt_eval_duration': 132494376, 'eval_count': 252, 'eval_duration': 2075405293, 'model_name': 'llama3.1:8b'} id='run--2f953541-153e-4ccf-b7a4-ddc64205a245-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 642, 'output_tokens': 252, 'total_tokens': 894}
